<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>College Event Registration</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Annual College Tech Fest</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#registration">Register</a></li>
                <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About the Event</h2>
            <p>Join us for the most anticipated campus event of the year, featuring hands-on hackathons, robotics showdowns, and seminars from industry experts.</p>
            
            <p><strong>Event Dates:</strong><time datetime="2026-10-15"> October 15</time> to<time datetime="2026-10-17"> October 17, 2026</time></p>
            
            <figure>
                <figcaption>Highlights from last year's CodeStorm Hackathon.</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </section>

        <section id="registration">
            <h2>College Event Registration Form</h2>

            <form action="#" method="POST">

                <p>
                    <label for="full-name">Full Name:</label><br>
                    <input type="text" id="full-name" name="fullName" required>
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label for="email-address">Email:</label><br>
                    <input type="email" id="email-address" name="email" required>
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label for="phone-number">Phone Number:</label><br>
                    <input type="tel" id="phone-number" name="phoneNumber">
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label for="dob">Date of Birth:</label><br>
                    <input type="date" id="dob" name="dateOfBirth">
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label for="branch-select">Branch OR Department:</label><br>
                    <select id="branch-select" name="branch">
                        <option value="">Please choose an option</option>
                        <option value="cse">Computer Science and Engineering</option>
                        <option value="ece">Electronics and Communication Engineering</option>
                        <option value="me">Mechanical Engineering</option>
                        <option value="ce">Civil Engineering</option>
                        <option value="ee">Electrical Engineering</option>
                    </select> 
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label>Current Year:</label><br>
                    <input type="radio" id="year-1" name="academicYear" value="1st">
                    <label for="year-1">1st Year</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="radio" id="year-2" name="academicYear" value="2nd">
                    <label for="year-2">2nd Year</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="radio" id="year-3" name="academicYear" value="3rd">
                    <label for="year-3">3rd Year</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="radio" id="year-4" name="academicYear" value="4th">
                    <label for="year-4">4th Year</label>
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label>Events to Attend:</label><br>
                    <input type="checkbox" id="event-hackathon" name="events" value="hackathon">
                    <label for="event-hackathon">CodeStorm Hackathon</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="checkbox" id="event-robotics" name="events" value="robotics">
                    <label for="event-robotics">RoboWars Championship</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="checkbox" id="event-gaming" name="events" value="gaming">
                    <label for="event-gaming">LAN Gaming Arena</label><br>
                    
                    <input type="checkbox" id="event-seminar" name="events" value="seminar">
                    <label for="event-seminar">AI and Future Tech Seminar</label>
                </p>

                <p>
                    <label for="referral-source">How did you hear about us?</label><br>
                    <textarea id="referral-source" name="referralSource" rows="4" cols="40"></textarea>
                </p>

                <p>
                    <input type="submit" value="Register Now">
                </p>

            </form>
        </section>

        <aside id="faq">
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            
            <h3>Who can participate?</h3>
            <p>Any currently enrolled student from any department can register for the events.</p>
            
            <h3>Is there a registration fee?</h3>
            <p>No, participation in all listed events is completely free of charge.</p>
        </aside>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <address>
            Contact us at:<a href="mailto:events@college.edu"> events@college.edu</a><br>
            Tech Fest Organizing Committee<br>
            Engineering Block A, University Campus<br>
            123 Education Lane, Cityville
        </address>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
